{"path":"container/flat_multimap/max_size","title":"std::flat_multimap<Key,T,Compare,KeyContainer,MappedContainer>::max_size","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::flat_multimap&lt;Key,T,Compare,KeyContainer,MappedContainer&gt;::</span>max_size","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/flat_multimap/max_size","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the maximum number of elements the container is able to hold due to system or library implementation limitations.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">size_type max_size<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the maximum number of elements the container is able to hold due to system or library implementation limitations. Equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/min\"><span class=\"kw1654\">std::<span class=\"me2\">min</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>size_type<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c.<span class=\"me1\">keys</span>.<span class=\"me1\">max_size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, c.<span class=\"me1\">values</span>.<span class=\"me1\">max_size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Maximum number of elements.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>This value typically reflects the theoretical limit on the size of the container, at most <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/numeric_limits\"><span class=\"kw351\">std::<span class=\"me2\">numeric_limits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>difference_type<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">max</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>. At runtime, the size of the container may be limited to a value smaller than <code>max_size()</code> by the amount of RAM available.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;flat_map&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;locale&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/flat_multimap\"><span class=\"kw3360\">std::<span class=\"me2\">flat_multimap</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> q<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">imbue</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"en_US.UTF-8\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Maximum size of a std::flat_multimap is \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> q.<span class=\"me1\">max_size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Maximum size of a std::flat_multimap is 768,614,336,404,564,650</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/flat_multimap/size\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>size</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns the number of elements <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/flat_multimap","title":"std::flat_multimap"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::flat_multimap<Key,T,Compare,KeyContainer,MappedContainer>::max_size","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Returns the maximum number of elements the container is able to hold due to system or library implementation…"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Maximum number of elements."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Notes","note":"This value typically reflects the theoretical limit on the size of the container, at most std::numeric_limits<difference_type>::max()."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"size","note":"returns the number of elements"}]}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":126,"codeBlockCount":2}
